    {
     "raw": "]Wn 03[",
     "command": "W"
    },
    {
     "raw": "First half of the sector wants you dead only because of"
    },
    {
     "raw": "what you know. Then, you seek help only to be suckered"
    },
    {
     "raw": "into a scheme by them to wipe out the other half of the"
    },
    {
     "raw": "sector. Third, when you learn their plans, you're sent"
    },
    {
     "raw": "to prison! Now that you've blasted your way to freedom,"
    },
    {
     "raw": "just how free are you? There is an invasion at hand,"
    },
    {
     "raw": "and it looks like you're the only one who can stop it."
    },
    {
     "raw": ""
    },
    {
     "raw": "Otherwise...     There won't be anyplace left to hide."
